{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26089","headline":"淮南卧病闻李相夷简移军山阳以靖东寇感激之下因抒长句 · 鲍溶","name":"淮南卧病闻李相夷简移军山阳以靖东寇感激之下因抒长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太白星前龙虎符，元臣出将顺天诛。\n教闻清净萧丞相，计立安危范大夫。\n玉帐黄昏大刁斗，月营寒晓小单于。\n鲁连未必蹈沧海，应见麒麟新画图。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}